OL,3,GNEWSA'Neglected' animals rescued from
OL,4,Asanctuary
OL,5,
OL,6,FDogs, cats, waterfowl and birds of prey
OL,7,Fhave been rescued after being found "in
OL,8,Fa state of neglect" in an animal
OL,9,Fsanctuary, police said.
OL,11,FThe animals were found living in
OL,12,F"extreme conditions" on land in
OL,13,FHalesowen in the West Midlands by
OL,14,Fofficers working with the RSPCA, and an
OL,15,Finvestigation has now begun.
OL,17,FWhile searching the site, nine
OL,18,F"non-viable" firearms and a ninja
OL,19,Fthrowing star weapon were also seized
OL,20,Fby West Midlands Police.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
