OL,3,GNEWSA'Neglected' animals rescued from
OL,4,Asanctuary
OL,5,
OL,6,FSgt Ben Dolan, from the force's
OL,7,Fwildlife, rural and heritage crime
OL,8,Fteam, said the animals were all alive,
OL,9,Fsafe, and in the RSPCA's care, adding:
OL,10,F"This was a distressing and complex
OL,11,Fincident."
